<title>CHILE: Masisa reports lower 9-month net.</title>
<headline>Masisa reports lower 9-month net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufacturing company Maderas y Sinteticos (Masisa) reported the following results in the first nine months of 1996 against the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996		9-mo 1995</p>
<p>    Net profit		    5.96			8.23</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    5.72			6.88</p>
<p>    Non-operating profit	  873 million	   2.16</p>
<p>    Total revenues	     50.12		     37.80</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>-- Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
